OL,3,APentagon stops using Anthropic AI tools
OL,4,Aafter blacklisting company, BBC told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Department of Defence is no
OL,7,Flonger using Anthropic's AI tools, an
OL,8,Fofficial has told the BBC, months after
OL,9,Fit designated the company a supply
OL,10,Fchain risk on national security
OL,11,Fgrounds.
OL,13,FThe Pentagon "has ceased the use of
OL,14,FAnthropic products", the department
OL,15,Fofficial said in a statement on Monday.
OL,17,FSecretary of Defence Pete Hegseth
OL,18,Flabelled Anthropic a supply chain risk
OL,19,Fin February, and announced that the
OL,20,FPentagon would stop using it by late
OL,21,FAugust. It is not clear why there has
OL,22,Fbeen a delay.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
