OL,3,APentagon stops using Anthropic AI tools
OL,4,Aafter blacklisting company, BBC told
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple people familiar with the
OL,7,Fmatter told the BBC that as recently as
OL,8,Flast week Anthopic's Claude model was
OL,9,Fstill being used by the department in
OL,10,Fresearch, analysis and intelligence
OL,11,Fgathering as well as in military
OL,12,Foperations against Iran.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
